Package: se
Architecture: any
Depends: openssh-client, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Fast connection to SSH
 se is a front end for SSH. It parses your SSH config file to pick your servers
 by number, by favorite letter or by fuzzy pattern.
